{
    "info":  {
                 "_postman_id":  "c01a2b3c-4d5e-4f6a-8b9c-0d1e2f3a4b5c",
                 "name":  "10 - Membership Plans",
                 "description":  "Endpoints to manage gym membership plans (durations, pricing, freeze limits, attendance limits).",
                 "schema":  "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
             },
    "item":  [
                 {
                     "name":  "Get Paged Membership Plans",
                     "event":  [
                                   {
                                       "listen":  "test",
                                       "script":  {
                                                      "exec":  [
                                                                   "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                                                                   "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                                                                   "});",
                                                                   "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                                                   "if (jsonData \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.items \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.items.length \u003e 0) {",
                                                                   "    pm.environment.set(\"membershipPlanId\", jsonData.data.items[0].id);",
                                                                   "}"
                                                               ],
                                                      "type":  "text/javascript"
                                                  }
                                   }
                               ],
                     "request":  {
                                     "description":  "### Endpoint Overview\n\nFetches a paginated list of membership plans for the current gym with dynamic sorting and filtering.\n\n---\n\n### Available Domain Attributes \u0026 Filter Reference\n\n| Attribute Name | Data Type | Filter Support | Description / Allowed Values |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `Id` | `int` | Exact | Unique Identifier |\n| `GymId` | `int` | Exact | Associated Gym ID |\n| `Name` | `string` | Searchable | Plan name (max 100 chars) |\n| `Description` | `string` | Searchable | Plan description (max 500 chars) |\n| `DurationDays` | `int` | Exact | Membership duration in days |\n| `Price` | `decimal` | Between | Plan price |\n| `FreezeDaysLimit` | `int` | Exact | Allowed freeze days |\n| `AttendanceLimit` | `int` | - | Max attendances (nullable) |\n| `IsActive` | `bool` | Exact | Active status |\n| `CreatedByPersonId` | `int` | Exact | Creator gym person ID |\n| `CreatedOn` | `DateTime` | Between | ISO creation date |\n\n---\n\n### Filter Usage Guide (For Request Body)\n\n- **Exact Filters (`exactFilters`):** Pass attribute name with array of string/enum values. Example: `\"exactFilters\": { \"DurationDays\": [\"30\"] }`\n- **Between Filters (`betweenFilters`):** Pass attribute name with `min` and `max`. Example: `\"betweenFilters\": { \"Price\": { \"min\": \"100\", \"max\": \"1000\" } }`\n\n---\n\n### Authorization\n\nRequires gym membership with role `Owner`, `Manager`, `Receptionist`, `Coach`, or `Member`. SuperAdmin bypasses all gym checks.",
                                     "method":  "POST",
                                     "header":  [
                                                    {
                                                        "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                        "value":  "application/json"
                                                    }
                                                ],
                                     "body":  {
                                                  "mode":  "raw",
                                                  "raw":  "{\n  \"pageNumber\": 1,\n  \"pageSize\": 10,\n  \"orderBy\": \"Id\",\n  \"orderDirection\": \"asc\",\n  \"filters\": {\n    \"betweenFilters\": {},\n    \"exactFilters\": {}\n  }\n}"
                                              },
                                     "url":  {
                                                 "raw":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/MembershipPlans",
                                                 "host":  [
                                                              "{{baseUrl}}"
                                                          ],
                                                 "path":  [
                                                              "api",
                                                              "MembershipPlans"
                                                          ]
                                             }
                                 },
                     "response":  [

                                  ]
                 },
                 {
                     "name":  "Get Membership Plan By Id",
                     "request":  {
                                     "description":  "Fetches a single membership plan by ID.\n\n### Response (`MembershipPlanRDTO`)\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `id` | `int` | Unique identifier |\n| `gymId` | `int` | Associated gym ID |\n| `name` | `string` | Plan name |\n| `description` | `string?` | Plan description |\n| `durationDays` | `int` | Duration in days |\n| `price` | `decimal` | Plan price |\n| `freezeDaysLimit` | `int` | Allowed freeze days |\n| `attendanceLimit` | `int?` | Max attendances |\n| `createdByPersonId` | `int` | Creator gym person ID |\n| `createdOn` | `DateTime` | ISO creation date |\n\nRequires gym membership (`GymAuthorize`, any role). SuperAdmin bypasses all gym checks.",
                                     "method":  "GET",
                                     "header":  [

                                                ],
                                     "url":  {
                                                 "raw":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/MembershipPlans/{{membershipPlanId}}",
                                                 "host":  [
                                                              "{{baseUrl}}"
                                                          ],
                                                 "path":  [
                                                              "api",
                                                              "MembershipPlans",
                                                              "{{membershipPlanId}}"
                                                          ]
                                             }
                                 },
                     "response":  [

                                  ]
                 },
                 {
                     "name":  "Create Membership Plan",
                     "event":  [
                                   {
                                       "listen":  "test",
                                       "script":  {
                                                      "exec":  [
                                                                   "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                                                                   "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                                                                   "});",
                                                                   "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                                                   "if (jsonData \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.id) {",
                                                                   "    pm.environment.set(\"membershipPlanId\", jsonData.data.id);",
                                                                   "}"
                                                               ],
                                                      "type":  "text/javascript"
                                                  }
                                   }
                               ],
                     "request":  {
                                     "description":  "Creates a new membership plan for the current gym. `gymId` and `createdByPersonId` are resolved from the authenticated user.\n\n### Request Fields (`MembershipPlanCDTO`)\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `name` | `string` | Yes | Plan name (max 100 chars) |\n| `description` | `string?` | No | Plan description (max 500 chars) |\n| `durationDays` | `int` | Yes | Must be greater than zero |\n| `price` | `decimal` | Yes | Must be non-negative |\n| `freezeDaysLimit` | `int` | Yes | Must be non-negative |\n| `attendanceLimit` | `int?` | No | Max allowed attendances |\n\nReturns `201 Created` with `Result<MembershipPlanRDTO>`.\n\n### Authorization\n\nRequires gym role `Owner` or `Manager`. SuperAdmin bypasses all gym checks.",
                                     "method":  "POST",
                                     "header":  [
                                                    {
                                                        "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                        "value":  "application/json"
                                                    }
                                                ],
                                     "body":  {
                                                  "mode":  "raw",
"raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Monthly Premium\",\n  \"description\": \"Unlimited gym access for one month\",\n  \"durationDays\": 30,\n  \"price\": 499.00\n}"
                                              },
                                     "url":  {
                                                 "raw":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/MembershipPlans/Create",
                                                 "host":  [
                                                              "{{baseUrl}}"
                                                          ],
                                                 "path":  [
                                                              "api",
                                                              "MembershipPlans",
                                                              "Create"
                                                          ]
                                             }
                                 },
                     "response":  [

                                  ]
